{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.poster.avif?t=1759760263\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.webm?t=1759760263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.mp4?t=1759760263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ember Island is a nostalgic 2D action-adventure game that blends the timeless soul of retro classics with modern design, graphics, and gameplay. Step into a hand-crafted world inspired by the beloved side-scrollers of classic 8 and 16-bit consoles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.poster.avif?t=1759760263\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.webm?t=1759760263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.mp4?t=1759760263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hero for hire, you'll explore a vibrant environment, engage in fast-paced combat, and discover a world brimming with unique challenges. We've built Ember Island for players who grew up with a controller in their hands and now seek a quality adventure that respects their time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The first 3</strong> exciting levels of the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Side-Scrolling Action:</strong> Run, jump, and fight your way through a beautifully crafted 2D world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Playable Characters</strong>\u00a0with unique melee and magical attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> your way through 14 of the 30 unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive, Modern Combat:</strong> Experience a responsive combat system that's easy to learn but difficult to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artful Pixel Design:</strong> Immerse yourself in a modern pixel art style that honors the classics while bringing a fresh, vibrant feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters:</strong> Test your skills against 3 of the 13 epic bosses designed to challenge your reflexes and wits.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026380?t=1759760263","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/d7792f68696c5ec31a302dd5c9751b95f996d96f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759760263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/fd6810e0d4ff6a60d9f8f9c24911dcc1a7d9461f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759760263","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026380/fd6810e0d4ff6a60d9f8f9c24911dcc1a7d9461f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759760263","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound"